SUMMARY:Wine Club Summer Social at grandview
DESCRIPTION:We will be CLOSED to the public for our Wine Club Summer Social & Pick-Up Party. \nCome pick up your wine\, sip sangria\, and meet other members while listening to summer tunes. Scott will be grilling up burgers/dogs so bring your own sides and enjoy a picnic dinner on the deck. \nThis is a MEMBER ONLY event and you must register in order to attend. \nClick Here to Register
URL:https://grandviewwines.com/vineyard-event/thursday-nights-at-grandview-2026-08-06/
LOCATION:Grandview Vineyard\, 1489 Grandview Rd\, Mount Joy\, PA\, 17552\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://grandviewwines.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/Wine-Club-Pick-Up-Party-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
