UID:5610-1786190400-1786208400@grandviewwines.com
SUMMARY:13th Anniversary Deck Celebration at grandview
DESCRIPTION:Did someone say DECK PARTY?!?13 Years ago\, mid-July\, we opened our deck and had our very first Deck Party! Music on the deck has been one of our favorite things and we’d love you to come see why. Live music 1-4pm. FREE ADMISSION 12-5pm\, Give-a-ways and fun!\n\nOur monthly Saturday Cigar night starts at 5pm. Admission $8 per person (or use your season deck pass!). Live music by Grant Bryan 6-8:30pm.
URL:https://grandviewwines.com/vineyard-event/12th-anniversary-deck-celebration-at-grandview/
LOCATION:Grandview Vineyard\, 1489 Grandview Rd\, Mount Joy\, PA\, 17552\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://grandviewwines.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Wine-By-the-Vine-Deck-Series-14.jpg
END:VEVENT
