CREATED:20260327T173605Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260724T210019Z
UID:6492-1786208400-1786222800@grandviewwines.com
SUMMARY:Saturday Cigar Nights
DESCRIPTION:(May – October from 5:00 – 9:00pm with live music 6:00 – 8:30pm) \nJoin us one Saturday each month to enjoy live music\, the beautiful view from our deck\, and a cigar while sipping on your favorite Grandview wine\, chilled local beer or specialty bourbon cocktail. We welcome back Cigars for Good as we help them raise money to support children’s charities! \nHere’s who’s playing:\n5/16 Ryan Moran\n6/13 Stu Huggins\n7/11 Matt Hostetter\n8/8 Grant Bryan\n9/12 Elijah Myers\n10/10 Ryan Moran   \nAdmission Ticket: $8/person (at door only) \nAdmission included for Saturday night pass holders.
URL:https://grandviewwines.com/vineyard-event/saturday-cigar-nights-4/2026-08-08/
CATEGORIES:Music,Recurring
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://grandviewwines.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Wine-By-the-Vine-Deck-Series-15.jpg
END:VEVENT
