SUMMARY:Taylor Swift Trivia at grandview
DESCRIPTION:…are you ready for it? Taylor Swift Trivia is your chance to show how much you know about the songs\, lyrics\, eras\, music videos\, and career moments that made Taylor one of the biggest artists in the world. Whether you’ve been here since the country days or jumped in somewhere along the way\, grab your fellow Swifties\, throw on your best era inspired outfit\, and come see who knows Taylor best!
