SUMMARY:90s Music Bingo at grandview
DESCRIPTION:Dig out the mixtapes because 90s Music Bingo is coming to Grandview Vineyard! No music knowledge is needed. Each player gets their own bingo card\, and each table gets a master sheet so you can follow along. We will play a 30 second clip of a 90s song\, announce the title\, and if it is on your card\, cross it off. Come sing along\, enjoy some wine\, and play for your chance to win some awesome prizes!
